<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/476b8a1ff127> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "the deepfaked videos were taken down after Carmel Central School District Board of Education became aware of the clips" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2623" .

