<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5f06d7e681b7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "On Sunday, the superintendent of Mahopac Central School District, five miles west of Carmel, issued a note to parents of Mahopac Middle School making them aware of a racist threat made by one of the district’s students against a teacher and Black students in the district." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2608" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cfce8e3ea4da> a airo:Evidence ;
