<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/38800a4491a9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a second video, a deepfake that imitated a member of the sheriff’s office spouted a string of racist slurs and threatened: “I’ll hang you like the KKK. The KKK legacy will return.”" ;
